, "c": 0.3, "x": 0.119, "y": 0.8689, "w": 0.07, "h": 0.0108}, {"t": "Most idioms containing the verb give are at", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5339, "y": 0.8823, "w": 0.3388, "h": 0.0132}, {"t": "This comes from Shakespeare's play King John.", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.8837, "w": 0.3552, "h": 0.0118}, {"t": "Gild means 'to cover something with a thin", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.8967, "w": 0.3244, "h": 0.0132}, {"t": "the entries for the nouns or adjectives in the", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5359, "y": 0.8967, "w": 0.3409, "h": 0.0118}, {"t": "layer of gold'. A lily is a very beautiful flower.", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.9113, "w": 0.3429, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "idioms, for example give sb a bell is at bell.", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5339, "y": 0.9113, "w": 0.3409, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "这个习语源于莎士比亚戏剧《约翰王》。gid 意", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1191, "y": 0.9258, "w": 0.3532, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "大多数含动词give 的习语列在该类习语中的名", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5339, "y": 0.9258, "w": 0.3409, "h": 0.0148}, {"t": "为“给⋯镀金”。lily（百合花）是一种非常漂", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.939, "w": 0.347, "h": 0.0175}, {"t": "词或形容词相关词条下，如 give sb a bell 在词", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5359, "y": 0.9404, "w": 0.3368, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "亮的花。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1191, "y": 0.9549, "w": 0.0616, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "条bell下。", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.5359, "y": 0.9549, "w": 0.078, "h": 0.0145}]}